{"type":"example","type_name":"Example","number":"","title":"Analysis of deviance for Engel’s data","title_html":"Analysis of deviance for Engel’s data","html":"<p>Continue the gamma/log model of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"exm-glm-engel\">@exm-glm-engel</span>, with <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"u\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> the centred logarithm of income and\n<span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"n=235\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>235</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. Fitting the three nested\nmodels gives</p>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 13%\">\n<col style=\"width: 17%\">\n<col style=\"width: 17%\">\n<col style=\"width: 17%\">\n<col style=\"width: 17%\">\n<col style=\"width: 17%\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"header\">\n<th>model</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: right;\">residual df</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: right;\">deviance</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: right;\">change</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: right;\"><span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\"